# Floating mana that pays a cost exactly one way is still the player's to press when the payment
# is shown (the operator, 2026-10-22): "i just tried to play doomsday and had BBB in the pool. all i
# could do was click auto to make payment. i should have been able to click on my black mana".
#
# Seat 0 (human) holds Dark Ritual and Doomsday with a Swamp out. Tapping the Swamp floats {B},
# which pays Dark Ritual; it resolves to {B}{B}{B}, which pays Doomsday's {B}{B}{B} one way.
turn=3
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Dark Ritual;Doomsday
humanbattlefield=Swamp
humanlibrary=Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=Island
ailibrary=Island;Island;Island;Island;Island;Island
